  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS-10533 PPG Sustainable Climate Resilient Electric Power Systems in Vanuatu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Preparation Grant (PPG) will support the development of a technically robust and approval-ready project document for the proposed SCREPS Project in Vanuatu. The preparatory process will translate the initial project concept into a detailed design for strengthening the reliability, sustainability, and climate resilience of electricity systems, particularly on Malekula and Espiritu Santo. It will assess and refine proposed investments in climate-proofed renewable energy infrastructure,</narrative>
  </description>
